# Paths the "Autopilot merge" workflow never merges: a PR touching any of them waits for Farouk.
# One bash pattern per line, matched against the whole repo-relative path (`*` also matches `/`).
# The workflow reads this file from main, so a PR cannot loosen the rules it is checked against.
# docs/AUTOPILOT.md describes the same list in words.

# CI, git hooks and Claude's own guard rails.
.github/*
.githooks/*
.claude/settings.json
.claude/hooks/*
.claude/skills/autopilot/*
CLAUDE.md
docs/AUTOPILOT.md

# Dependencies (CLAUDE.md: a new dependency needs a reason Farouk accepts).
*package.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
pnpm-workspace.yaml
.npmrc
.nvmrc

# Deploy and infrastructure config.
*vercel.json
*railway.json
*railway.toml
*Dockerfile*
*.dockerignore
docker/*
docker-compose.yml

# Secrets template.
.env*
